            "id": 145157,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que fait l'instruction spéciale <code>console.log()</code> ?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Il affiche une valeur dans la console</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Il crée une variable</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il affiche une valeur dans la console.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145158,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que montre ce code dans la console ?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dungeon 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Dungeon 1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelName</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Dungeon 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145159,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mets le code dans l'ordre pour afficher la valeur <code>100</code> dans la console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>const playerHealth = 100;</code> suivi de <code>console.log(playerHealth);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
